      "product": {
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>Introducing our One-Piece Swimsuit with Swim Skirt for Women and Girls - the perfect addition to your swimwear collection!</p>\n<p>Crafted with soft and comfortable material, this swimsuit is designed to provide both style and comfort. The fashion-forward design features a swim skirt, adding a touch of elegance to your swimwear look. The high-quality material ensures a comfortable and secure fit, while the chest pad provides added support and coverage.</p>\n<p>This swimsuit is perfect for various occasions, including swimming, wading, and beach activities. The matching mother and daughter option makes it a great choice for family vacations and outings, creating a beautiful and stylish look for both mom and daughter.</p>\n<p>With its elegant design and high-quality material, this one-piece swimsuit is a must-have for any fashion-conscious woman or girl. Don't hesitate to add it to your collection and make a fashion statement this summer!</p>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Height (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Weight (kg / lbs)</th>\n<th>Bust (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Hips (cm / in)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<!-- Children's Sizes -->\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2-3 years</td>\n<td>80-100 cm / 31.5-39.4 in</td>\n<td>10-15 kg / 22-33 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4-5 years</td>\n<td>102-110 cm / 40.2-43.3 in</td>\n<td>15.5-17.5 kg / 34-38.6 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5-6 years</td>\n<td>110-120 cm / 43.3-47.2 in</td>\n<td>17.5-20 kg / 38.6-44 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-8 years</td>\n<td>120-130 cm / 47.2-51.2 in</td>\n<td>19-22.5 kg / 41.9-49.6 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8-10 years</td>\n<td>131-145 cm / 51.6-57.1 in</td>\n<td>22.5-31 kg / 49.6-68.3 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 10-12 years</td>\n<td>145-153 cm / 57.1-60.2 in</td>\n<td>31-37.5 kg / 68.3-82.7 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- Women's Sizes -->\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>86.36-88.9 cm / 34-35 in</td>\n<td>66-68.58 cm / 26-27 in</td>\n<td>92.71-95.25 cm / 36.5-37.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>91.44-93.98 cm / 36-37 in</td>\n<td>71.12-73.66 cm / 28-29 in</td>\n<td>97.79-100.33 cm / 38.5-39.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>97.79-101.6 cm / 38.5-40 in</td>\n<td>77.47-81.28 cm / 30.5-32 in</td>\n<td>104.14-107.95 cm / 41-42.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>105.41-109.22 cm / 41.5-43 in</td>\n<td>85.09-88.9 cm / 33.5-35 in</td>\n<td>111.76-115.57 cm / 44-45.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1557/1635/products/O1CN01YSUaY11hIq3nr923e__3379404255-0-cib_480x480.jpg?v=1679330509\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1557/1635/files/O1CN01idLxmD1hIq3lE4Rn5__3379404255-0-cib_480x480.jpg?v=1679331284\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1557/1635/files/O1CN01crvT4Q1hIq3kOvU7s__3379404255-0-cib_480x480.jpg?v=1679331308\" alt=\"\"></p>",
